# Pairing gossip topics (T-122): each villager can be asked about a neighbour they are paired with. Offered after a chat once both are known. Compiled to zz_fs_gossip_topics.json.

topic juno.gossip.bram
  npc juno
  label Ask about Bram
  plays juno.gossip.bram.d
  if hearts:juno>=3 && flag:met.bram
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue juno.gossip.bram.d
n0 juno: Bram pretends he doesn't read my labels! He moved one yesterday! It said 'Chair (Do Not)'! He sat on it! Defiantly!

topic bram.gossip.juno
  npc bram
  label Ask about Juno
  plays bram.gossip.juno.d
  if hearts:bram>=3 && flag:met.juno
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue bram.gossip.juno.d
n0 bram: Hm. Juno labeled my lunch. It said 'Lunch (Eaten)'. Accurate.
  next n1
n1 bram: Don't tell her.

topic hazel.gossip.ione
  npc hazel
  label Ask about Ione
  plays hazel.gossip.ione.d
  if hearts:hazel>=3 && flag:met.ione
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue hazel.gossip.ione.d
n0 hazel: (Ione rearranged the third shelf.) Nobody noticed. (I noticed.) I said nothing. It is our understanding.

topic ione.gossip.hazel
  npc ione
  label Ask about Hazel
  plays ione.gossip.hazel.d
  if hearts:ione>=3 && flag:met.hazel
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue ione.gossip.hazel.d
n0 ione: Hazel reads at the window every afternoon. She thinks I don't see.
  next n1
n1 ione: I don't mention it. The light is kind to her.

